    "anatomy": "Biventricular myocardium, synthetic healthy subject, 30 time steps",
    "canonical_variant": "patient01_healthy from the STRAUS multi-modality simulation; the ULTRASOUND modality's mesh sequence, 30 frames covering one whole cardiac cycle",
